"}, "body": "あなたのSkebの宣伝イラストを描いて欲しいです。\n\n野生児と暮らす。の柴川みらいちゃんは貝殻の見た目をした水着の上に、自動膨張式のライフジャケットを着用していて、「なんで私が...」という表情をしています。\n\n煽り文で、Skeb募集中！こんな依頼でもOK！等とかいてあります。\nwafuも添えてくれるとより良いです。\n\nあなたに良き日が訪れますように。\n\n\n原文\nI want you to draw a promotional illustration of your Skeb.\n\nLive with a wild child. Mirai Shibakawa wears a self-inflating life jacket on a swimsuit that looks like a seashell, and has the expression \"Why am I ...\".\n\nWe are looking for Skeb with a fanciful sentence! Such a request is OK! And so on.\nIt would be better if wafu was also included.\n\nMay you have a good day.", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@3nu_s/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1224782, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7bd7797a/uploads/origins/f31beb1e-8873-47cb-90b9-970387a75ee3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d50f2d707c486b9b3a777e52aeb4c4c3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7bd7797a/uploads/origins/f31beb1e-8873-47cb-90b9-970387a75ee3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d50f2d707c486b9b3a777e52aeb4c4c3, https://si.imgix.net/7bd7797a/uploads/origins/f31beb1e-8873-47cb-90b9-970387a75ee3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cec2ab92b1ebe9f24b9d582674c0df46 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7bd7797a/uploads/origins/f31beb1e-8873-47cb-90b9-970387a75ee3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3e2cad5679e1368da1aa12ef1ce1f48 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7bd7797a/uploads/origins/f31beb1e-8873-47cb-90b9-970387a75ee3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5c9e5c0b68ee9e3c868201d1c800dea5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7bd7797a/upl